      "content": "but \"finding a way to just be\" feels like more work. it's just another way to delay the inevitable. if nothing matters, then even the effort to \"be\" or find \"beautiful noise\" is just a distraction from the reality that it's all empty. sometimes i feel like the only logical response to that emptiness is to just... exit. like, why continue the struggle if there's no point to the game?",
